      "description": "Render a Knowledge Graph, or a list of its Subgraphs, for publication to a CDN at a publication root URL, and report a status and one message. The same step for a staging preview and for a release — only the root URL and the target differ. Names the target's Tool, never its steps: GitHub Pages (`gh-pages`) is one Tool, and it carries its own subprocess.",
